direction: down
ui: "nori.app: Swift, UIKit" {class: you}
lib: "nori-ios static library"
host: nori-host session
core: Engine and core crates
http: nori-http
shim: "Audio shim: NoriAudio.m"
unit: AURemoteIO

ui -> lib: C calls in nori_ios.h
lib -> ui: reports, pages, covers
lib -> host: opens and drives
host -> core: plays and reads
core -> http: API, covers, audio
lib -> shim: open, start, stop
shim -> unit: runs
unit -> lib: render callback
